#: ../../contribute/building.md:68
msgid "Add the following entries to `.vscode/settings.json`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../contribute/building.md:78
msgid ""
"`liveServer.settings.root`: Sets the root of the output website for live "
"previews. Must be changed alongside the `tasks.json` command."
msgstr ""

#: ../../contribute/building.md:80
msgid ""
"`liveServer.settings.wait`: Tells the live server to wait with the update"
" in order to give Sphinx time to regenerate the site contents and not "
"refresh before the build is complete."
msgstr ""

#: ../../contribute/building.md:82
msgid ""
"`python.terminal.activateEnvInCurrentTerminal`: Activates the automatic "
"virtual environment, so you can build the site from the integrated "
"terminal."
msgstr ""

