msgstr ""

#: ../../contribute/building.md:145
msgid ""
"Implementation detail: two problem matchers were needed to be defined, "
"because VS Code doesn't tolerate some problem information being "
"potentially absent. While a single regex could match all types of errors,"
" if a capture group remains empty (the line number doesn't show up in all"
" warning/error messages) but the `pattern` references said empty capture "
"group, VS Code discards the message completely."
